  unitName: Twin Flash Rickel
  unitId: 20213
  unitNumber: 291
  description: A marksman who took on the name of her beloved guns, Rickel. Witnessing
    her quick draw skills there are few who ever doubted that title, though she never
    once divulged her true name. She handled Rickel as if they were her lovers, seemingly
    in response to which their power increased. Watching her as she lived with her
    guns, eventually people came to see Rickel as not just the pair of guns, but
    as the guns and her.
  summonDesc: There's nothing that<br>Rickel can't turn to ice!<br>Leave the rest
    to us!
  fusionDesc: Thanks, I guess.<br>I won't let the power you've<br>given Rickel go
    to waste.
  evoDesc: No matter how much I change,<br>I will never be separated <br>from my
    guns, "Rickel."
  element: 2
  rarity: 3
